  "title": "Skill Consolidation and Agent Self-Evolution",
  "summary": "SkillPyramid introduces a framework for self-evolving agents to consolidate and generalize skills, while SkillValuation and Agent Behavior frameworks explore methods for managing evolving agent skills and ensuring functional security. These developments address challenges in skill acquisition and retention.",
